{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MmOeHlgl6Y1794615333.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>上諭集團供股集資逾3,400萬元。</p><p></p><p>供股比例2供1，每股供股價0.1元，較上日收市價折讓七成，將發行最多逾3.42億股供股股份，集資所得主要用於獲取並執行新的建築相關地基工程項目，以及為現有業務開發人工智能工作流程系統，餘額用作一般營運資金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:37:52.251514+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:32.051865+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T01:30:52.296727+00:00","content_hash":"c2259607c7ef97c69946f210f5de4dcd12d7cd2fa292f52e3da953cee6a0ae3d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}